# {{platformName}} Community Platform

## Overview
This document describes the community platform for {{platformName}}, a social networking service that connects users with shared interests and communities. The platform will support user profiles, content sharing, messaging, and community building features.

## Functional Requirements

### User Management
- **User Registration**: Email, social login (Google, Facebook, Apple)
- **Profile Management**: Personal information, profile picture, cover photo
- **Privacy Settings**: Control over profile visibility and data sharing
- **Account Verification**: Email and phone number verification
- **Account Security**: Two-factor authentication, login alerts

### Content Management
- **Post Creation**: Text, images, videos, links, polls
- **Content Editing**: Edit and delete own posts
- **Content Moderation**: Report inappropriate content, admin moderation
- **Content Discovery**: Explore page, trending content, personalized feed
- **Content Sharing**: Share posts from other users

### Social Features
- **Friend/Follow System**: Connect with other users
- **Groups/Communities**: Create and join interest-based groups
- **Messaging**: Direct messaging, group chats
- **Notifications**: Real-time notifications for interactions
- **Reactions**: Like, love, laugh, sad, angry reactions
- **Comments**: Threaded comments with replies

### Media Management
- **Photo/Video Upload**: Upload and share media content
- **Media Processing**: Automatic resizing, format conversion
- **Media Storage**: Cloud storage with CDN distribution
- **Media Privacy**: Control over who can view media
- **Albums**: Organize photos into albums

### Search and Discovery
- **User Search**: Find users by name, username, or interests
- **Content Search**: Search posts by keywords, hashtags
- **Group Search**: Discover groups by topic or name
- **Trending Topics**: See what's trending on the platform
- **Recommendations**: Personalized content and user recommendations

### Analytics and Insights
- **Profile Analytics**: View counts, engagement metrics
- **Content Analytics**: Post performance, reach, engagement
- **Audience Insights**: Follower demographics and behavior
- **Business Analytics**: For business accounts and advertisers

## Non-Functional Requirements

### Performance
- **Response Time**: Page load time < 2 seconds for 95% of requests
- **Concurrent Users**: Support for 1 million+ concurrent users
- **Media Processing**: Photo processing < 5 seconds, video processing < 30 seconds
- **Real-time Features**: Instant messaging and notifications
- **Scalability**: Horizontal scaling to handle growth

### Security
- **Data Encryption**: AES-256 encryption for data at rest, TLS 1.3 for data in transit
- **Authentication**: OAuth 2.0 with multi-factor authentication options
- **Authorization**: Role-based access control with privacy settings
- **Content Safety**: AI-powered content moderation
- **Privacy Compliance**: GDPR, CCPA, and other privacy regulations

### Reliability
- **Uptime**: 99.95% system availability
- **Fault Tolerance**: Automatic failover and redundancy
- **Backup and Recovery**: Daily backups with point-in-time recovery
- **Disaster Recovery**: Recovery time objective (RTO) < 4 hours

### Usability
- **Intuitive Interface**: User-friendly interface with minimal learning curve
- **Mobile First**: Responsive design optimized for mobile devices
- **Accessibility**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance
- **Multi-language**: Support for {{language}} and other major languages
- **Customization**: Customizable themes and layouts

## Technical Architecture

### System Components

#### Frontend
- **Web Application**: React.js with TypeScript and Redux
- **Mobile Apps**: Native iOS (Swift) and Android (Kotlin) applications
- **Progressive Web App**: PWA for cross-platform support
- **Admin Dashboard**: React-based admin interface

#### Backend
- **API Gateway**: NGINX or cloud API gateway
- **Microservices**: Node.js with TypeScript and NestJS
- **Real-time Service**: WebSocket server for messaging and notifications
- **Media Processing**: FFmpeg-based media processing service
- **Search Service**: Elasticsearch for search functionality

#### Database
- **Primary Database**: PostgreSQL for relational data
- **Document Database**: MongoDB for flexible content storage
- **Cache Layer**: Redis for high-speed data access
- **Search Engine**: Elasticsearch for search functionality
- **Time-Series Database**: InfluxDB for analytics data

#### Infrastructure
- **Cloud Platform**: AWS or Google Cloud Platform
- **Containerization**: Docker for application containerization
- **Orchestration**: Kubernetes for container orchestration
- **Content Delivery**: CDN for media and static assets
- **Message Queue**: Apache Kafka for event streaming

